descriptions.job-0thlpii:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by CPAs, tax attorneys, and engineers, Taxbit is the leading innovator automating global tax reporting for the digital economy. Taxbit&#39;s AI-enabled platform streamlines compliance related to digital assets, payments, and other financial transactions. Its unique combination of deep subject matter expertise and AI-forward technology have made it a fast-growing disruptor trusted by the world&#39;s leading fintechs, marketplaces, digital asset players, Big 4 accounting firms, traditional enterprises, and government agencies. Backed by top-tier Silicon Valley VCs, Taxbit&#39;s team is located across offices in San Francisco, New York, Seattle, Salt Lake City, London, Madrid, and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity for Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taxbit is seeking an Enterprise Account Executive, reporting to the Head of Sales, to drive new logo acquisition across leading crypto, fintech and marketplace firms globally. This role is central to Taxbit’s growth as tax information reporting requirements rapidly expand across new jurisdictions, regulatory regimes, and product categories. The ideal candidate brings a strong blend of enterprise sales execution, strategic account development, and intellectual curiosity to understand complex, global, multi-product organizations. Success in this role requires the ability to navigate large enterprises, build relationships across product, tax, finance, and engineering stakeholders, and position Taxbit as the trusted compliance infrastructure for modern digital businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires professional proficiency in both English and Mandarin. This role is open only to candidates who currently reside in Singapore and are legally authorized to work in Singapore (e.g., holders of a valid Employment Pass or Permanent Resident status). The position requires on-site availability and alignment with local business operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new logo revenue by identifying, engaging, and closing new enterprise customers across crypto, fintech and marketplaces globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a disciplined pipeline through a combination of strategic outbound prospecting, partner collaboration, and marketing-driven opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep prospect research to understand company business models, regulatory exposure, and operational workflows that create tax information reporting obligations, and convert those insights into new customer opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex enterprise sales cycles from initial discovery through contract execution, including multi-threaded stakeholder engagement across tax, finance, product, compliance, and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans for target prospects, identifying key decision-makers, economic buyers, and internal champions to accelerate deal velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling executive-level presentations that position Taxbit as the trusted compliance infrastructure for modern digital businesses navigating global tax information reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Marketing, Partnerships, Product, and Technical SMEs to align messaging, validate solution fit, and successfully progress opportunities through the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure smooth customer transitions to Customer Success following deal close, setting the foundation for long-term adoption, partnership, and future expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep expertise in Taxbit’s platform and global tax information reporting frameworks (including 1099 reporting, DAC8, CARF, and other emerging regulations) to effectively advise prospects and differentiate Taxbit in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Top Performer Account Executive or in a similar role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8+ years as a full-cycle Enterprise Account Executive (will consider mid-market AE Top Performers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success closing $100K+ ACV enterprise deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent internal promotions or demonstrated career progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No short stints at companies (very few or none under 2-3 years)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in fintech, crypto, payments, marketplaces, or regulated SaaS, or equivalent experience selling into highly regulated financial environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills with the ability to translate regulatory complexity into revenue strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding customer communication and executive presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead and influence deeply cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-paced, highly regulated, and rapidly evolving market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taxbit in the News&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bybit-collaborates-with-taxbit-to-ensure-seamless-financial-compliance-for-global-and-eu-users-302610053.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Bybit Collaborates with Taxbit to Ensure Seamless Financial Compliance for Global and EU Users&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-expands-global-platform-to-power-carfdac8-compliance-at-scale-302411671.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Expands Global Platform to Power CARF/DAC8 Compliance at Scale&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-unveils-industry-first-global-reporting-platform-bridging-digital-and-traditional-finance-302304125.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Unveils Industry-First Global Reporting Platform, Bridging Digital and Traditional Finance&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-named-to-2024-deloitte-technology-fast-500-list-of-fastest-growing-companies-in-north-america-302313123.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Wins the Digital Banker’s 2025 Digital Assets Award for Best Technology Solution Provider for Digital Assets - Tax &amp;amp; Compliance Automation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/taxbit-named-to-2024-deloitte-technology-fast-500-list-of-fastest-growing-companies-in-north-america-302313123.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Named to 2024 Deloitte Technology Fast 500™ List of Fastest-Growing Companies in North America&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ffnews.com/newsarticle/paytech/taxbit-appoints-former-oecd-advisor-colby-mangels-as-global-head-of-government-solutions/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Taxbit Appoints Former OECD Advisor Colby Mangels as Global Head of Government Solutions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.taxbit.com/webinars/unlocking-compliance-at-scale-carf-dac8-reporting-for-digital-asset-platforms/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Unlocking Compliance at Scale: CARF/DAC8 Reporting for Digital Asset Platforms&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimers&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;By submitting an application for this role, you certify that the information contained in the application is correct to the best of your knowledge. You understand that to falsify information is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;grounds for refusing to hire you, or for discharge should you be hired.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For US roles, employment with the Company is at will unless otherwise stated in a written agreement signed by the CEO of the Company.&amp;nbsp; This means that either the Company or the employee can terminate the employment at any time and for any reason, with or without notice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-14j8k4q:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mission for Brokerage Operations is to provide insane customer focus&amp;nbsp; with a safety always mindset as we strive to democratize finance for all. We stride on being in the continual state of improvement in our journey for operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Brokerage Operations Intern, you’ll gain hands-on experience across multiple operational domains—supporting processes that power Robinhood’s trading, clearing, and customer experience. You’ll learn how data, technology, and risk management intersect in brokerage operations and work on projects that use analytics, process improvement, and light automation to improve performance, accuracy, and customer trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chicago, IL &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;office with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across Robinhood Financial (Introducing Broker) and Robinhood Securities (Clearing Broker) to learn the many aspects that comprise the operations of FINRA-registered broker-dealers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with subject matter experts to analyze operational data, identify efficiency opportunities, and make process improvement recommendations, including automation and dashboard enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support small-scale technical projects such as reconciling datasets, improving data quality, or building Business Intelligence dashboards using tools like Retool or Superset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a capstone project applying analytical and problem-solving skills to a real operational challenge, culminating in a presentation to senior leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a full-time, degree-seeking Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s program in Business, Economics, Engineering, Data Analytics, Finance, or a related field with an expected graduation date in Winter 2027/Spring 2028&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with experience performing analytics using SQL or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about how brokerage operations, risk management, and market infrastructure work together in a fintech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills and comfort engaging with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual agility — comfortable asking questions, challenging assumptions, and thinking critically about processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market competitive compensation structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly lifestyle wallet for personal wellness, learning and development, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time away including company holidays, paid time off, and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lively office environment with catered meals, fully stocked kitchens, and geo-specific commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot; data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;The expected salary range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. This role is also eligible to participate in a Robinhood bonus plan.\n\nUS Zone 1: $24.65 - $29 per hour\nUS Zone 2: $24.65 - $29 per hour\nUS Zone 3: $23.8 - $28 per hour&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:4540,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;6&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;7&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;8&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;10&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-formula=&quot;=if(R[0]C6=&amp;quot;Salary&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;The expected salary range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. This role is also eligible to participate in a Robinhood bonus plan and Robinhood’s equity plan.&amp;quot;&amp;amp;char(10)&amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C15 &amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C14 &amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C13, &amp;quot;The expected salary range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. This role is also eligible to participate in a Robinhood bonus plan.&amp;quot;&amp;amp;char(10)&amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C15 &amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C14 &amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C13)&quot;&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected hourly range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$28&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$28 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0ereley:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood Derivatives (RHD) is Robinhood’s newly formed entity that focuses on futures, event contracts, and options on futures. Our operations and trading team will help coordinate and lead business operations and internal functions for this entity to ensure a successful setup, launch, and opportunity to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Futures &amp;amp; Prediction Markets Operations Intern, you will perform essential daily duties to keep our futures and prediction markets business running efficiently, including clearing and settlement of futures and prediction markets, futures options trades and event contracts, analyzing trade and position reconciliations, resolving various futures and event contract trading issues, and reviewing several regulatory reports to ensure proper compliance. The role will work on initial setup of futures and event contract operational processes, tools, documentation, and workflows. Additionally, you’ll be working with various third party clearing firms, exchanges and vendors to maintain a proper working relationship and will be working closely with vital internal teams including CX, Risk, Legal, Compliance, Engineering, Financial Crimes, Finance, and Customer Trust and Safety to meet customer needs and expectations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chicago, IL &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review operational reports and assist in reviewing and performing operational tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist operations and compliance with audit inquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Futures Risk in performing analytical functions to support certain risk functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a subject matter expert with exposure to leadership and different teams across Robinhood&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamline operational and risk workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a full-time, degree-seeking program in Finance, Business or a related field with an expected graduation date in Winter 2027/Spring 2028.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about the futures market, derivatives, and back office clearing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated history of operational excellence and problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and influencing skills to work with colleagues across the company to quickly resolve issues and develop long term strategies for growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize and complete multiple daily tasks and projects with various deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market competitive compensation structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly lifestyle wallet for personal wellness, learning and development, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time away including company holidays, paid time off, and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lively office environment with catered meals, fully stocked kitchens, and geo-specific commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot; data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;The expected salary range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. This role is also eligible to participate in a Robinhood bonus plan.\n\nUS Zone 1: $24.65 - $29 per hour\nUS Zone 2: $24.65 - $29 per hour\nUS Zone 3: $23.8 - $28 per hour&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:4540,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;6&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;7&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;8&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;10&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-formula=&quot;=if(R[0]C6=&amp;quot;Salary&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;The expected salary range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. This role is also eligible to participate in a Robinhood bonus plan and Robinhood’s equity plan.&amp;quot;&amp;amp;char(10)&amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C15 &amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C14 &amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C13, &amp;quot;The expected salary range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. This role is also eligible to participate in a Robinhood bonus plan.&amp;quot;&amp;amp;char(10)&amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C15 &amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C14 &amp;amp; char(10)&amp;amp; R[0]C13)&quot;&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected hourly range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$26&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$26 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0apw2cq:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Operations Excellence Senior Program Lead on the CX Operations Excellence team, you&#39;ll own and optimize the workflows, routing logic, and agent tooling that power Coinbase&#39;s global Customer Experience operation. This team designs the CX operating system, covering end-to-end workflows, SOPs, routing, and tooling across Scaled Operations and Premium and Wealth, directly tied to CSAT, retention, FCR, and handle time. You&#39;ll turn ambiguous, multi-year CX goals into a clear portfolio of programs that measurably improve quality, efficiency, and the Specialist experience across in-house and BPO sites worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own program strategy for broadly scoped CX operations initiatives, translating business problems into structured plans and driving execution from discovery through global rollout while managing trade-offs between time, scope, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimize end-to-end CX workflows, from contact entry points and routing logic through Specialist handling and resolution, to reduce friction, standardize experiences across sites and vendors, and ensure the right work reaches the right Specialist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Tooling, WFM, Analytics, and Operations to shape queue design, case allocation rules, channel strategy, and automation/AI use cases that maximize productivity without sacrificing quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain CX standards and governance, including SOPs, playbooks, dashboards, and process excellence frameworks that provide a single source of truth for how workflows and tools operate across regions and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive change management at scale by crafting communications, enablement plans, and feedback loops that land new workflows, routing strategies, and tools with global teams and ensure continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage operational metrics, quality outcomes, CSAT/effort scores, and capacity data to identify opportunity areas, size problems, set targets, and validate whether workflow and tooling changes deliver expected results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in customer support operations, process excellence, or program management, with a track record designing and scaling CX workflows in multi-product, multi-geo environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing end-to-end workflows, SOPs, and routing logic across multiple teams, geographies, or vendor partners in high-volume operations (case management, contact routing, agent desktops, automation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead cross-functional programs involving 4+ stakeholder teams (Operations, Product, Engineering, Analytics, WFM) from discovery through measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data and experimentation mindset with hands-on experience using analytics to size problems, prioritize opportunities, and validate the impact of workflow changes on metrics like CSAT, recontact rate, and handle time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record producing structured decision docs, workflow specs, and executive recommendations that drive alignment and action across senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PID: P77123&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$154,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0t5m3hm:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Founded 20 years ago and headquartered in Chicago, the DV Group of financial services firms has grown to more than 600 people operating throughout North America, Europe and Asia. Since spinning out of a large brokerage firm in 2016, DV Trading has rapidly scaled as an independent proprietary trading firm utilizing its own capital, trading strategies, and risk management methodologies to provide liquidity to worldwide financial markets and hedging opportunities to commodity producers and users. Now, DV group affiliates include two broker dealers, a cryptocurrency market making firm, and a bourgeoning investment adviser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated, quick-learning student developer to join our equities desk for the 2027 Summer Internship. You will gain hands-on experience developing components of our cutting-edge, low-latency trading platform. Working alongside experienced developers and traders, you&#39;ll contribute to real projects—whether it&#39;s optimizing exchange connectivity in C++ or building research pipelines in Python, depending on your primary skills and interests—while learning how technology drives competitive advantage in global financial markets.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Based on your primary language, you will focus on either low-latency system components (C++) or data/backtesting tooling (Python), with opportunities to learn both over time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Assist in the design, development, and maintenance of low-latency trading system components using &lt;strong&gt;C++&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build tools and scripts in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; for data analysis, backtesting, and strategy research&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work alongside senior traders, quantitative researchers, and software developers to understand the full trading technology stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Optimize and refactor existing code for performance and reliability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews and team discussions, contributing fresh ideas and learning industry best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Further responsibilities may be driven by the individual’s interests and specific skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Currently pursuing a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expected graduation date: 2027 or 2028&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in either C++ or Python (with some exposure to the other language through coursework, personal projects, or prior internships)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of data structures, algorithms, and object-oriented design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Linux/Unix environments and basic networking concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Detail-oriented with a strong work ethic and eagerness to learn quickly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Genuine interest in algorithmic trading and financial technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to work collaboratively in a fast-paced, team-oriented environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prior internship or project experience in low-latency systems, trading, or large-scale data processing is a plus but not required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;DV is not accepting unsolicited&amp;nbsp;resumes&amp;nbsp;from search firms. Only search firms with valid, written agreements with DV should submit&amp;nbsp;resumes&amp;nbsp;in response to DV’s posted positions. All&amp;nbsp;resumes submitted by search firms to DV via e-mail, the Internet, personal delivery, facsimile, or any other method without a valid written agreement shall be deemed the sole property of DV, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by DV. DV is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-0cmog16:
&lt;h3&gt;About the position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Swag Program Manager to join Jane Street&#39;s global merchandise program, which supports our recruiting, new hire onboarding, community outreach, and internal culture initiatives. You&#39;ll join a small team working closely with Recruiting, Events, and Design teams across the firm, along with our external production, warehousing, and logistics partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll contribute to both strategy and day-to-day operations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with teams across the firm to turn their goals into program roadmaps, forecast demand, and keep projects on schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing new products with our Design team that feel current and true to the brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning vendor relationships and vetting and matching vendors to projects as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running the day-to-day operations that keep our global products, inventory, and shipping running smoothly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining success metrics, reporting on program health, and improving processes as the program scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 7+ years of experience across some combination of merchandising, product development, buying, supply chain, operations, procurement, or logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a track record of developing physical products, such as apparel or promotional merchandise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a working knowledge of production and decoration methods (e.g., embroidery, screen printing, sublimation, custom manufacturing) and their tradeoffs on quality, cost, and lead time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable building forecasts and models from multiple data sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent communicator and project manager with experience coordinating complex, multi-stakeholder initiatives; comfortable managing contractors and vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized with excellent attention to detail&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A motivated self-starter who can handle competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about the operations of the firm and how your role fits into the bigger picture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-0wtk3oq:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role spearheads client acquisition and growth for StraitsX&#39;s pioneering digital payment solutions. You are a senior member of the team and will be responsible for driving sales, building strong relationships with stakeholders, and crafting data-driven strategies to propel StraitsX&#39;s position within the dynamic digital asset and blockchain payments landscape.&amp;nbsp;You will work closely with the Head of Payments and internal teams from Product, Operations, Compliance and Legal to craft, design and execute winning solutions to fit the needs of our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute targeted strategies to acquire new merchant and corporate accounts in the payments space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster and nurture strategic relationships with key decision-makers at new and existing clients, collaborating effectively across internal teams as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employ a consultative, solution-oriented approach, demonstrating a firm understanding of Payments, APIs and the Blockchain space to effectively address client needs and successfully close deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibit a robust network of clients and prospects in the Payments space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively address client inquiries and resolve concerns related to StraitsX&#39;s solutions, prioritizing client satisfaction and fostering long-term retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reach out and engage with top Enterprise Companies, Payment Firms, Merchants to build a sustainable pipeline of new accounts, leading the sales cycle from pitching, onboarding, to closing, ensuring a first-class client experience throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own, monitor and track sales to identify growth opportunities and refine sales strategies for optimal performance for existing clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with internal teams like Compliance, Product, Operations, and Management to streamline sales operations and ensure alignment with overall business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a deep understanding of emerging trends, market shifts, competitor activity, and new product developments within the digital asset, blockchain and payments landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business Administration, Finance, or a related discipline is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 7 years of experience in B2B sales, preferably within banking, fintech, payments, blockchain, or digital assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of exceeding sales targets, acquiring strategic clients, and driving sustainable revenue growth in a competitive environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, relationship-building, presentation, and commercial negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities, with the capacity to interpret sales data and identify growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment, with a strong interest in innovation and emerging financial technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using CRM platforms, such as HubSpot, together with proficiency in Microsoft Excel, PowerPoint, and Word.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and spoken Mandarin proficiency would be an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1lm37l6:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a technology company focused on improving the conditions for economic growth and prosperity. We build programmable financial infrastructure, rethinking from first principles how financial services should work, to make it easier and cheaper for any business to start and scale. More than 10 million &lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.com/customers&quot;&gt;businesses&lt;/a&gt; build on Stripe, spanning the economic frontier—from solo founders to established enterprises—united by a practical focus on growth. The most ambitious companies in the world use Stripe as core infrastructure to grow faster. They process trillions of dollars a year on Stripe, equivalent to around 1.6% of global GDP. While economic growth makes everyone better off, open markets also enable greater variety. When any business can easily serve a global customer base, the quality and diversity of products in the world increase, and craft and creativity are unleashed into the smallest niches. Our own growth is wholly contingent on the success of the businesses building on Stripe. We therefore invest back into our technology at an unusual rate. We make &lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.com/roadmap&quot;&gt;upgrades to our products&lt;/a&gt; every single day to deliver compounding gains to our customers. We maintain some of the most &lt;a href=&quot;https://status.stripe.com/&quot;&gt;reliable APIs&lt;/a&gt; on the internet. We build entirely new &lt;a href=&quot;https://tempo.xyz/&quot;&gt;pieces&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href=&quot;https://mpp.dev/&quot;&gt;financial&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://joinopenstandard.com/&quot;&gt;infrastructure&lt;/a&gt; to enable new ideas. And our significant advances in &lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.com/radar&quot;&gt;risk and fraud&lt;/a&gt; infrastructure over many years are making the internet economy safer and more accessible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Though people at Stripe don’t tend to take themselves seriously, Stripe is a fairly serious place: our customers are depending on us for their livelihoods. We admire ambition, intensity, curiosity, humility, and rigor. The most effective people become knowledgeable about many domains besides their own. Any company is an applied exercise in understanding some aspect of society or the market. In working with so many (especially the new and innovative ones), we think that Stripe is one of the very best places to learn about how the world works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is large enough that individual products and projects can be rapidly deployed to a meaningful fraction of the world’s businesses, but small enough that individual agency still has outsized impact. Small teams can impact how millions of businesses grow. Right now the global economy is replatforming around AI, creating new opportunities for growth. We’re at the center of this, and we think the best work is still in front of us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet this moment, we’re looking for people who move with urgency, like hard problems, and want their work to matter at a time of great change. If that’s you, there’s no better place to build your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambitious builder: You’re energized by building solutions without clear precedent and solving problems with far-reaching consequences. Successful Stripes are deeply curious, and prefer the joy of discovery to the comfort of certainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous thinker: You appreciate that things worth doing are rarely simple. You enjoy working on problems that have never been tackled before.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable problem solver: You adapt quickly and treat obstacles as opportunities.&amp;nbsp; At Stripe we embrace kindness while encouraging Stripes to take measured risks and act boldly, even in the absence of consensus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in computer science or a directly related field, obtained by summer 2027, or equivalent work experience; New grad candidates should have no more than 18 months of professional experience (excluding internship experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and familiarity with programming, either through side projects or classwork. We work mostly in Java, Ruby, JavaScript, Scala, and Go. We believe new programming languages can be learned if the fundamentals and general knowledge are present.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience from either previous internships or working collaboratively on multi-person coding projects (in a university or professional setting).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn unfamiliar systems and form an understanding of those systems, through independent research and working with a mentor or subject matter experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written communication skills, with the ability to explain your work to stakeholders, team members, and other Stripes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to leverage AI tools to accelerate development while applying rigorous critical thinking and professional judgement to review, refine, and validate all outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One or more areas of specialized knowledge (frontend, backend, infrastructure or other technologies) balanced with general skills and knowledge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in code review practices, and an understanding of how to safely update production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with navigating and managing work in large code bases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading small projects independently, and contributing to larger projects alongside peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate with high agency in navigating complex technical obstacles independently, knowing precisely when to unblock oneself and when to ask for help.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-0u6z88a:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Frontend (Platform - Identity)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, Frontend on the Identity Horizontal team within the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot;&gt;Platform&lt;/a&gt; group, you&#39;ll own the user-facing experiences for login, signup, OAuth, account security, and multi-factor authentication that every Coinbase customer touches first. This team builds and maintains the frontend surfaces that establish the right level of assurance for every identity, enabling products to ship faster while blocking attackers and satisfying regulators. You&#39;ll lead end-to-end frontend delivery across authentication surfaces, drive the Native vs. Webview architecture strategy, and mentor engineers as the team scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end frontend projects from design doc through implementation, deployment, and monitoring for login, signup, OAuth, account security, and multi-user/multi-organization support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author and review technical design documents, breaking down ambiguous, complex initiatives into executable plans for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Identity&#39;s Native vs. Webview architecture strategy for authentication surfaces, evaluating trade-offs across latency, reliability, and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve technical debt and code quality issues proactively across the team&#39;s codebase, not just your own scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead team rituals including on-call, code review, and incident response, and mentor L04 engineers on frontend craft and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of production frontend engineering experience with React and TypeScript, including independently leading end-to-end delivery of ambiguous, complex projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Authored and driven technical design documents through cross-functional review and implementation on at least 2-3 major initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to identify and resolve systemic technical debt across a team&#39;s codebase, with measurable improvements to reliability or developer velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring engineers and leading team rituals (on-call rotations, code review standards, incident response).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$186,065&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$218,900 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1hngdnu:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe, LLC. is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and enhance all aspects of our global corporate cash investment program, including strategies, policies and systems/operations, performance and risk metrics;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and synthesize trends in global financial markets and macroeconomic developments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with financial partners such as asset managers, custodians and service providers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional partners, as well as external stakeholders, to unlock and manage global interest income opportunities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build observability tools and deliver data insights relating to investments and yield optimization;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify capital markets system needs and work with the respective teams to build the required infrastructure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Capital Markets team in executing complex projects by assuming project and cross-functional coordination responsibilities; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the strategy and execution of the Capital Markets team long term roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must have a Bachelor&#39;s degree or foreign equivalent in Business, Math, Economics, Finance, Statistics, Engineering or related field, plus 7 years of experience in Capital Markets or Corporate Treasury of which, at least 5 years must be post bachelors, progressive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must also have 7 years of experience in each of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investments, interest rate risk management, and global cash management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed income, interest rate derivatives, FX, hedging strategies, and analyzing macroeconomic trends;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating financial forecasts and models; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in financial markets, FX or Fixed Income, in G10 or emerging markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5 years of experience in running deadline-oriented deals or projects, including planning, stakeholder management, operational best practices, and tracking results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;2 years of experience in Bloomberg Terminal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $199,222 - $235,200/yr.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary range represents the base salary range for the role and any sales commissions/sales bonuses targets, if applicable, would be in addition to the base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;40 hrs/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;50% Telecommuting permitted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multiple Positions Available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional benefits for this role may include: equity, company bonus or sales commissions/bonuses; 401(k) plan; medical, dental, and vision benefits; and wellness stipends. NY55&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

descriptions.job-1oqpsyy:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is looking for a senior product strategist-operator to join the Strategic Business Performance (SBP) team. SBP is the&amp;nbsp;&quot;connective tissue&quot; of Stripe. You will have a front-row seat to how the company operates and a direct hand in ensuring we&amp;nbsp;hit our most important goals. If you are a technical strategist who loves to move fast and fix high-stakes problems, we’d love to hear from you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SBP is a small, high-leverage group within Central Strategy &amp;amp; Operations at Stripe. Our mission is to create strategic&amp;nbsp;clarity around Stripe’s performance. We work with partner teams to report on the business; dive into it to support and&amp;nbsp;pressure-test our strategy, driving change wherever we find soft spots and enabling the success of other teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who connects across data, financials and product &amp;amp; business strategy and can unearth a signal in the noise and either fix the problem directly or convene the right people to fix it fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will work cross-functionally within our group and across Stripe’s technical and user-facing teams to solve&amp;nbsp;problems and design workflows that benefit our users. Specifically:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the &quot;Signal&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;: You will define and maintain the metrics that actually matter for in-year performance. You’ll&amp;nbsp;develop a &quot;morning read&quot; discipline—a curated, high-signal view of the business that drives immediate action,&lt;br&gt;moving far beyond standard dashboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep-Dive Interventions&lt;/strong&gt;: You will lead &quot;surge&quot; projects to diagnose and unblock critical goals at risk. You aren&#39;t just identifying problems; you are staying in the arena until the trajectory has measurably changed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge Product &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: You will translate long-horizon corporate theses into in-year operational reality. You’ll&amp;nbsp;take ambiguous opportunities that cut across product, risk, and marketing and decompose them into structured&lt;br&gt;workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synthesize for Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: You’ll think ahead of our executive team, preparing CEO/COO-level materials that translate unstructured signals into structured diagnoses they can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pressure-test our Assumptions&lt;/strong&gt;: You’ll work closely with Corporate Strategy and Product teams to identify gaps&amp;nbsp;between our external market forces and our internal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these&amp;nbsp;requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in product/data analytics within product organizations or strategic business performance&amp;nbsp;teams at high-growth tech companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Product Strategy, Product Management, or GM-style roles where you owned a P&amp;amp;L or a specific&lt;br&gt;business outcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply curious about business models and data, probing into signals, understanding trends and customer usage patterns to uncover novel insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of directly driving business growth through analytical insights and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI to enhance decision-making and operational efficiency, know when and how to use the right AI tools to move faster without sacrificing rigor or quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and the ability to understand the technical mechanics of how software products are built and scaled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating ambiguous, cross-functional problems and leading high-stakes interventions with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with fintech products or complex financial systems is a plus, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience facilitating senior leadership/ stakeholder meetings to drive meaningful conversations regarding&amp;nbsp;Stripe’s business performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payments ecosystem, or experience in finance or fintech is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build trust and partner with senior leaders and CXOs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical proficiency in SQL / Python / R and data analysis; ability to self-serve and perform independent deep-dives into complex datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving creative solutions with and effectively informing the roadmap of cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand the implications of Stripe ships such as product features, policy changes, and marketing&amp;nbsp;outreach on the user experience and resulting support experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1ecrmne:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;section-header section-header--large font-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;About Digital Asset &amp;amp; the Canton Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Asset builds the technologies that are reshaping the foundations of financial markets. Our mission is to create the world’s most trusted, privacy-enabled, and interoperable digital infrastructure for global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of this mission is the Canton Network - the blockchain purpose-built for institutional finance. Uniquely combining privacy, compliance, and scalability, Canton enables real-time, secure settlement across multiple asset classes. Governed by the Canton Foundation with participation from leading financial institutions, it is the proven link between the promise of blockchain and the power of global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014 and headquartered in New York City, with offices in London, Zurich, Budapest, Hong Kong, and Sydney— we are on a mission to transform finance— and that transformation is now playing out rapidly on the Canton Network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you’re interested in playing a crucial role at the intersection of traditional and crypto-capital markets and want to help bring the next trillion dollars of finance on-chain, join us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Staff CX Software Engineer is a role for people that come with prior experience and exposure to distributed computing, Canton Network and our product, including topology and performance considerations. These individuals will stand in front of a client to provide sound advice, and to provide a technical leadership role for the team when working with clients on client solutions. They are comfortable with facing off to executive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides direction to clients on physical and logical architectures for Canton Network solutions and integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gives direction on Canton Network topology concerns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinates and leads planning of complex, cross-functional initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serves as the expert in Canton Network and DA Products&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverages proficiency in multiple other languages.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimates highly complex solutions and systematically decompose complex technical problems to arrive at a solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defines strategy for a performance test plan: proactively reasons about, identifies, and remediates performance issues in solutions using Canton Network and DA Product components; and prioritizes salient performance concerns of a system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverages a level of expertise in a subset of Canton Network and DA Products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as a subject matter expert for other CX staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with and customizes helm charts to enable a client easy onboarding to k8s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of software engineering experience, including a history of successfully delivering complex systems or integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Breadth: Comprehensive understanding of full-cycle technical delivery, from system design and API strategies to cloud architecture and data modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has working knowledge of our product and Canton OS source code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery Excellence: Ability to establish engineering standards, design reusable components, and unblock delivery teams across multiple workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative Mindset: Experience in a consulting or client-facing role; able to translate complex business requirements into scalable technical roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial services domain knowledge and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-moving environment with multiple competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, pragmatic and adaptable, and able to learn quickly in complex environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Digital Asset, we are committed to compensation structures that reward impact consistently across our global teams. We support our people at every stage of life with comprehensive, family-forward benefits and flexible working models designed to help you do your best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support the well-being of our team members. Health and insurance benefits vary by region to ensure local relevance and compliance, and may include medical, dental, and vision coverage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Digital Asset is an equal opportunity employer committed. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, sex, religion, sexual orientation, age, disability, citizenship status, veteran status, or any other basis protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Eligibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If and as required by applicable law, all persons hired to work at Digital Asset will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work in the location for which they have an offer to work and to complete the necessary employment eligibility verification documents upon hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ccommodations&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Applicants with disabilities who require accommodation during the application or interview process should contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@digitalasset.com&quot;&gt;talent@digitalasset.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Privacy Act (CCPA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If you are based in California, we encourage you to read this important information for California residents linked &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.digitalasset.com/ccpacpranotice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0ed5y5m:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Software Engineer on the Compute Platform team within the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Product Group, you&#39;ll own the routing layer that connects every service at Coinbase to its customers. The Compute Platform team builds and operates core compute orchestration infrastructure based on CNCF technologies including Istio, Envoy, and Kubernetes. You&#39;ll design and deliver net-new routing capabilities that improve the scalability, reliability, and performance of application traffic across our entire fleet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the design, development, and automation of routing infrastructure that directs application traffic to Kubernetes backends at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build capabilities on top of Envoy-based reverse proxies, Istio gateways, Ambient mesh, and SPIFFE service authentication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable improvements to latency, reliability, and performance of application routing systems across Coinbase&#39;s production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the paved-road developer experience for operating applications at Coinbase, with emphasis on AI-driven tooling, processes, and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, Reliability, and Observability teams to ensure routing infrastructure meets cross-cutting platform requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in software engineering and infrastructure roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on engineering experience with application routing technologies including reverse proxies, ingress controllers, CDN/WAF, and service mesh&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in one or more systems programming languages (Go, Python, or Java) with experience building and shipping production-grade infrastructure services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience scaling backend infrastructure on AWS, with working knowledge of networking, compute, and container orchestration services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with the CNCF ecosystem (Kubernetes, Envoy, Istio) and proven ability to extend or contribute to these technologies in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of diagnosing complex distributed systems issues, identifying root causes, and driving them to resolution independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality, including applying AI tooling to infrastructure workflows to improve efficiency, reliability, or developer velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$218,025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$256,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1atvq0a:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Bridge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bridge is building a new payments platform powered by stablecoins to make global money movement simpler, faster, and more accessible. Through our APIs, businesses can send and receive funds across borders, give customers access to dollars through virtual accounts, and disburse USD globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe stablecoin rails will become a foundational part of financial infrastructure, moving and settling trillions of dollars worldwide. Bridge is helping bring that future forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team has built financial infrastructure at companies including Coinbase, Stripe, Square, Brex, Upstart, DoorDash, and Airbnb. We are united by the conviction that stablecoins can materially improve how money moves around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and ship end-to-end product experiences across frontend applications, backend services, APIs, and data systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design reliable, performant, and intuitive interfaces for developers, operations teams, and end users interacting with Bridge products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain the APIs and backend systems that power global payments, virtual accounts, and payouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own projects from technical design through launch and iteration, often operating with substantial autonomy and without dedicated product management support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug and resolve production issues across the stack, with a focus on reliability, performance, and customer impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make thoughtful tradeoffs among business priorities, user experience, speed of execution, and long-term technical quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of professional software-engineering experience. We are open to candidates across a range of seniority, from experienced individual contributors through senior technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and shipping production software across both frontend and backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with backend services, SQL databases, and API design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building polished, maintainable web applications and collaborating closely on product and user-experience decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of ownership, with the ability to lead technical projects and influence product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to write modular, well-tested, maintainable code while remaining pragmatic and moving quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-paced, ambiguous environment and diving into unfamiliar problem spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to produce clear technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, sound judgment, and a commitment to continuously improving the product for partners and end users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building developer-facing API products or platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with financial infrastructure, payments, money movement, or other regulated products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in or experience with stablecoins, blockchain systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing systems that require high reliability, strong security controls, and careful operational discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-10oqi0a:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Founded in Silicon Valley in 2009 by Marc Andreessen and Ben Horowitz, Andreessen Horowitz (aka a16z) is a venture capital firm that backs bold entrepreneurs &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/news-content&quot;&gt;building the future&lt;/a&gt; through technology. We are &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/portfolio&quot;&gt;stage agnostic&lt;/a&gt;. We invest in seed to venture to &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/growth/&quot;&gt;growth-stage technology&lt;/a&gt; companies, across &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/ai/&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/bio-health/&quot;&gt;bio + healthcare&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/consumer/&quot;&gt;consumer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/&quot;&gt;crypto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/enterprise/&quot;&gt;enterprise&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/fintech/&quot;&gt;fintech&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/games&quot;&gt;games&lt;/a&gt;, and companies building toward &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/american-dynamism/&quot;&gt;American dynamism&lt;/a&gt;. a16z has $100B+ under management across multiple funds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We’ve established a team that &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/about/&quot;&gt;is defined by&lt;/a&gt; respect for the entrepreneur and the company-building process; we know what it’s like to be in the founder’s shoes. We’ve invested in &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/portfolio/&quot;&gt;companies&lt;/a&gt; like Anduril, Airbnb, Coinbase, Cursor, Databricks, Deel, Figma, GitHub, Roblox, SpaceX, and Stripe. Our team is at the forefront of new technology, helping founders and their companies impact and change the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Executive Assistant will work closely with top-level Executives. This is an opportunity to work alongside individuals who are driven by excellence and a passion for technology. The ideal candidate is a team player with exceptional communication skills, meticulous attention to detail and creative problem-solving skills. This role supports General Partners, and requires the ability to juggle competing responsibilities while prioritizing. Daily responsibilities include calendar management, coordinating meetings, travel and logistics, and prioritizing across multiple leaders. We are looking for someone with strong experience working with executive teams in fast-paced environments, and the ability to handle sensitive information with excellent judgment, diplomacy and discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role requires an onsite presence in our New York City office, 5 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To join our team, you should be excited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Build and cultivate long-term relationships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Handle highly confidential information and documents with discretion and confidentiality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Manage and maintain multiple executive calendars, including recurring meetings, prioritizing appropriately and using good judgment in offering solutions to complex scheduling and meeting planning needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Meetings will include Board meetings, Executive off-sites and ongoing staff meetings. This includes but is not limited to, attendee communications, venue management/coordination, audio/video set-up and management as needed, catering and program material preparation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Proactively manage communication, and respond to urgent inquiries from internal / external stakeholders on the executives’ behalf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Process and track expenses in a timely manner for the executives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Operate with exceptional attention to detail. Anticipate potential changes or shifts in priorities amidst simultaneous demands for attention&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Provide overall data management to executives. Inclusive of:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Organize and compile to facilitate exec presentations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Track and drive completion of key deliverables, proactively following up on outstanding items as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Provide innovative and creative methods for continued improvements to administrative processes as the company scales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;8+ years of high level experience supporting multiple senior level executives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;A strong team player, who thrives in a collaborative setting and works well within a matrixed environment, poised and able to work with individuals at all levels of the organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Proactive, positive and personable with excellent communication skills and an upbeat, “can do” attitude- willing to take initiative with confidence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Resilient, with ability to manage multiple projects and deliver quality work to deadlines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Discretion, diplomacy and excellent judgment; high degree of integrity when dealing with confidential and sensitive information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Exceptional attention to detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Strong calendar management and prioritization skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency with Gmail, Google Calendar as well as key applications such as Word, Excel, Powerpoint and Zoom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role is between $149,000 - $165,000, actual starting pay may vary based on a range of factors which can include experience, skills, and scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role is eligible to participate in the a16z carry program and various discretionary bonus programs as well as benefit and perquisite plans including health, dental, vision, disability, life insurance, 401K plan, vacation, and sick leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a16z culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do only first class business and only in a first class way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We take a long view of relationships, because we are in the relationship business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We believe in the future and bet the firm that way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We are all different, we recognize that, and we win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We celebrate the good times&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do it for the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We play to win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;At a16z we are always looking to hire the absolute best talent and recognize that diversity in our experiences and backgrounds is what makes us stronger. We hire candidates of any race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, marital or family status, disability, Veteran status, and any other status. These differences are what enables us to work towards the future we envision for ourselves, our portfolio companies, and the World.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Our organization participates in E-Verify. Click&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1674233464432000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1-yT1T3ug2xE734Ge62fLD&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; to learn about E-Verify.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Andreessen Horowitz hereby reserves the right to make use of any unsolicited resumes received from outside recruiting agencies and / or individual recruiters without being responsible for payment of any fees asserted from the use of unsolicited resumes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0tfpp4a:
&lt;h3&gt;About the position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to give you a real sense of what it&#39;s like to work at Jane Street full time while also providing a truly unparalleled educational experience. As an intern, you are paired with full-time employees who act as mentors, collaborating with you on real-world projects we actually need done.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a procurement intern, you’ll work side-by-side with full-timers to learn how we procure goods&amp;nbsp;and services for the firm on a global basis. You will see how we develop and execute requests&amp;nbsp;for proposal (RFPs), negotiate with vendors, level disparate quotes, manage inventory, raise&amp;nbsp;purchase orders, handle global logistics, and analyze spend data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your internship project might focus on finding and implementing ways to improve efficiency in&amp;nbsp;our internal processes, or helping us to plan and research our sourcing efforts. Your mentors will&amp;nbsp;come from different areas of the team, so you’ll gain a better understanding of the planning,&amp;nbsp;execution, and problem solving required pre-purchase and post-purchase. Your daily project&amp;nbsp;work will be complemented by lunch seminars, real-time discussion on the desk, and classes&amp;nbsp;that give you a sense of the broader fundamentals of Jane Street’s business and how your daily&amp;nbsp;work fits into the big picture of our firm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about Jane Street&#39;s internship program &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.janestreet.com/join-jane-street/internships/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’ve never thought about a career in finance, you’re in good company. Many of us were in the same position before working here. If you have a curious mind, a collaborative spirit, and a passion for solving interesting problems, we have a feeling you’ll fit right in. We&#39;re more interested in how you think and learn than what you currently know. You should be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about supply chain management, including one or more of the following areas: global sourcing, inventory management, logistics, transportation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally majoring in supply chain management, business administration/management, operations, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly proficient in Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually curious, collaborative, and eager to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Humble and unafraid to ask questions and admit mistakes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong communicator, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a highly collaborative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who enjoys working on problems that don’t have clear answers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-1qbaz3e:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT HUT 8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imagine the ultimate destination for those who want to work at the cutting edge of technology, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;energy,&lt;/span&gt; and infrastructure. Hut&amp;nbsp;8 is on a mission to build and operate some of the world’s largest data centers for next-generation computing workloads, including AI, Colocation, Cloud, and Bitcoin Mining. We are proud to offer interesting and challenging opportunities for individuals who want to build teams, solve problems, and make an impact from day one. If you’re an ambitious individual looking for a career that is as rewarding as it is challenging, you’ve come to the right place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;774&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 759.219px;&quot; width=&quot;582&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Materials Manager manages on-site material receiving, laydown, storage, and inventory control for a data center build, ensuring material availability aligns with the installation schedule. This is a boots-on-the-ground ownership role: if the field is waiting on material that&#39;s already on site but can&#39;t be found, that&#39;s the failure this role exists to prevent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Some of the key responsibilities you should expect are the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Receiving &amp;amp; Inspection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run the site receiving operation: delivery scheduling and gate coordination, unloading and inspection, OS&amp;amp;D documentation with photos, and same-day receiving records against POs. Coordinate closely with the Logistics &amp;amp; Expediting Manager on inbound major equipment and with vendors on discrepancies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Laydown, Warehouse &amp;amp; Preservation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage laydown yards, warehouse space, and climate-controlled storage with a documented location system. Enforce OEM preservation and maintenance requirements for stored major equipment - transformer nitrogen/oil checks, generator block heaters and rotation, VFD and electronics climate requirements - with logged compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory Control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain accurate inventory records tied to storage locations; run cycle counts; reconcile physical inventory against POs, BOMs, and issue records; and report shortages against upcoming installation needs before they become field delays.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Material Issue &amp;amp; Returns&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run a disciplined material issue process to trade partners - requisitions, staging, sign-out accountability - and manage returns, surplus, and attrition tracking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work the three-week lookahead with superintendents and the planner: verify material readiness for upcoming work fronts, flag at-risk items, and stage material to work areas ahead of need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Site Coordination &amp;amp; Safety&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate crane and forklift resources for material moves, keep laydown areas safe and organized, and support site logistics planning as the project density increases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;774&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;582&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- 5+ years in site materials management, warehousing, or field logistics on industrial, power, or data center construction projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Direct experience receiving and storing major electrical/mechanical equipment, including OEM preservation requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Strong inventory-control discipline: location systems, cycle counts, and reconciliation habits that hold up under audit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Fluency with inventory/ERP tools and Excel; barcode/scanning system experience a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Comfortable operating daily in an active construction environment alongside superintendents and trade crews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Forklift certification and rigging awareness preferred; OSHA 10/30 a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Organized, accountable, and allergic to &#39;it&#39;s here somewhere.&#39;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE WORK ENVIRONMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-time on-site role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT MAKES HUT 8 A GREAT PLACE TO WORK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hut 8 offers a benefits and wellness program that includes medical, dental, vision, life, and&amp;nbsp;short-term and long-term disability insurance, as well as paid time off.&amp;nbsp;We are proud to invest in building the best team in the industry. At all levels of the organization,&amp;nbsp;we are driven by an entrepreneurial spirit, radical transparency, and relentless growth mentality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Hut 8, you will have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Work with bright, driven peers from a range of educational and professional backgrounds&amp;nbsp;including software development, energy, engineering, entrepreneurship, investment&amp;nbsp;banking, private equity, and management consulting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Design and pitch new products, services, and other initiatives to a leadership team&amp;nbsp;consisting of serial entrepreneurs and seasoned executives and backed by a board of&amp;nbsp;directors consisting of industry veterans of energy, finance, and government&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Debate ideas and alternatives in a truly meritocratic setting where the learning curve is&amp;nbsp;steep and the lessons come from both senior and junior members of the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Build a lifelong network of friends and professional connections at the cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;intersection of technology, energy, and infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-061fdd6:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Engineering Manager on the FINT (Financial Intelligence) team within FinHub in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot;&gt;Platform&lt;/a&gt; group, you&#39;ll lead the engineers building the account and transaction history infrastructure that underpins every Coinbase product. FINT owns the universal account primitive, the real-time transaction history engine, and the internal developer experience platform for FinHub. You&#39;ll guide your team through a critical inflection point: re-architecting these foundational systems for the next decade of scale while enabling new financial products like sub-accounts, retirement accounts, and agentic trading experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow a team of 6 engineers across multiple levels, coaching on technical excellence, career development, and organizational impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the re-architecture of core account and history systems to support new product primitives and higher throughput demands at Coinbase&#39;s next stage of growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Finhub Tools roadmap, building internal UIs, dashboards, and agentic workflows that accelerate engineering and operations teams across the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape architectural decisions across distributed systems, streaming pipelines, and full-stack tooling, fostering a culture of high-quality code and thorough design reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, finance, and engineering leadership to define and execute a quarterly roadmap, breaking complex infrastructure projects into iterative, shippable milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the talent organization to recruit exceptional engineers and own engineering quality processes including SLA accountability, incident response, and on-call practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills and experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in software engineering with at least 2 years of engineering management experience, including hiring, coaching, and developing engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record delivering and operating distributed systems at scale in production, with hands-on ability to review code, lead incidents, and triage issues when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success translating ambiguous, long-horizon technical problems into concrete execution plans with measurable milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with financial systems, event-driven architectures, or high-precision transaction processing where correctness and reliability are critical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort leading teams with diverse scope (backend services, streaming pipelines, and full-stack tooling) with an appreciation for developer and operator UX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$218,025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$256,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1uz0acq:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;374&quot; data-end=&quot;399&quot;&gt;About the team + role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;843&quot;&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;1229&quot;&gt;The Android team’s mission is to redefine how millions of users engage with their finances. We&#39;re focused on delivering intuitive, scalable, and inclusive mobile experiences that empower our customers to build better financial futures. We collaborate closely with Product, Design, and Backend Engineering to ensure every interaction on Android reflects quality, performance, and care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Trading Products team&lt;/strong&gt; creates the experiences that bring Robinhood’s trading ecosystem to life for customers every day. Team Experience is responsible for making those journeys feel fast, intuitive, and dependable—so customers can engage with sophisticated trading products through simple, well-crafted mobile experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1491&quot; data-end=&quot;1596&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1598&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1831&quot; data-end=&quot;1849&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the technical direction for Android experiences across high-impact product areas, building intuitive, elegant, and reliable mobile systems using Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and modern Android APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, ambiguous initiatives end to end—from early product and technical strategy through architecture, implementation, experimentation, launch, and long-term evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Managers, Designers, Backend Engineers, and Data Scientists to shape roadmaps, influence product decisions, and deliver solutions that create meaningful customer and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and uphold engineering standards, architecture patterns, and development practices thatimprove quality, scalability, maintainability, and developer velocity across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical leader and multiplier by mentoring engineers, driving design reviews, unblocking critical decisions, and raising the overall bar for execution, craftsmanship, and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2396&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2401&quot; data-end=&quot;2419&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2422&quot; data-end=&quot;2491&quot;&gt;8+ years of professional experience developing Android applications, including experience leading large-scale or technically complex mobile initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2422&quot; data-end=&quot;2491&quot;&gt;Deep proficiency with Kotlin and/or Java, and strong expertise in Android SDK fundamentals and architecture patterns such as MVVM, with a track record of making sound architectural tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2422&quot; data-end=&quot;2491&quot;&gt;Strong experience with Jetpack Compose, Coroutines and Flow or RxJava, and common Android libraries such as Retrofit and Room, with the ability to apply them at scale in complex production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2422&quot; data-end=&quot;2491&quot;&gt;Excellent collaboration and communication skills, with the ability to influence cross-functional partners and align teams around technical and product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2422&quot; data-end=&quot;2491&quot;&gt;Demonstrated track record of leading through ambiguity, driving architecture across multiple projects or surfaces, and mentoring senior engineers while elevating engineering standards beyond your immediate team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2422&quot; data-end=&quot;2491&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2961&quot; data-end=&quot;2964&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2966&quot; data-end=&quot;2983&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2986&quot; data-end=&quot;3037&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3040&quot; data-end=&quot;3165&quot;&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3168&quot; data-end=&quot;3276&quot;&gt;Best-in-class benefits including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3279&quot; data-end=&quot;3376&quot;&gt;Lifestyle wallet — a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3379&quot; data-end=&quot;3469&quot;&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3472&quot; data-end=&quot;3554&quot;&gt;Generous time off including company holidays, PTO, sick time, and parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3557&quot; data-end=&quot;3648&quot;&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, stocked kitchens, and commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1598&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 (Menlo Park, CA; New York, NY; Bellevue, WA; Washington, DC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$230,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$270,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$203,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$238,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 3 (Lake Mary, FL; Clearwater, FL; Gainesville, FL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$211,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1609qlm:
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;French speaking&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Customer Success Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to help us build our SaaS-based anti-money laundering solutions, which empower organisations to fight financial crime! We are building cutting-edge solutions that help create a safer world and stop money from ending up in the hands of criminals. You will join the customer success team, where you will be charged with nurturing relationships with a portfolio of our customers. You will be a trusted advisor to our clients helping them to get the best results from using the platform while feeding back ideas to the product development teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Customer Success Manager, you will&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a portfolio of strategic &lt;strong&gt;French-speaking&lt;/strong&gt; customers throughout the entire lifecycle, from onboarding and training to adoption and ongoing success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the dedicated contact and own the overall relationship with your clients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that an implementation plan is in place for each new customer and take responsibility for a successful onboarding process, working with the various stakeholders, e.g. their technology team, compliance &amp;amp; risk teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide proactive support to our clients by helping them to increase adoption, improve utilization and take responsibility for minimizing churn and ensuring renewal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing support to our clients, responding to their queries and coordinating across the various ComplyAdvantage teams to solve their problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-sell and upsell, expanding contract revenue in conjunction with the sales/account management team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a primary role in shaping the product roadmap based on customer feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support/drive new feature roll outs, including formal and informal training of customers and the internal sales/marketing teams, drafting client communications, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute towards market development work, e.g. working with marketing to create high quality collateral/content and working with the product team to define future requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Function as the voice of the customer and provide internal feedback on how ComplyAdvantage can better serve our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a true passion for customers – fanatical about getting them the right outcomes and becoming their advocate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;French language proficiency at a native or near-native level&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable working with C-Suite stakeholders, to understand their objectives and align our solutions to meet their needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand your client’s business and drive value towards positive business outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Politely and confidently handle objections from clients, working collaboratively towards mutually beneficial outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in technology and a basic grasp of tools like APIs and cloud platforms will go a long way here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a proactive self-starter that is self-directed and able to solve problems and execute independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong process management skills, you will be able to manage a varied workload with multiple deadlines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong relationship management skills and the ability to coordinate across teams and build consensus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally have 2-4 years in a similar or adjacent customer facing role, with proven experience working with mid-market accounts in a B2B environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally have previous project management experience and have worked in a start-up previously&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity as we want you to have a part of what we are building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Time Off Policy to promote work-life balance and well-being&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual learning budget to support professional growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget to set up your home office upon joining&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leave and childcare benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance and medical coverage through BUPA, including pre-existing conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension contribution through The People&#39;s Pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to empower every business to eliminate financial crime.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By harnessing AI, a unified platform, and an extensive partner ecosystem, we help customers turn compliance into a catalyst for growth, operational resilience, and enduring regulatory trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 3,000 enterprises across 75 countries rely on our end-to-end platform and the world’s most comprehensive financial crime risk intelligence. With full-stack agentic automation, we help organizations automate up to 95% of KYC, AML, and sanctions reviews, cut onboarding times by 50%, reduce false positives by 70%, and handle 7x more work with the same staff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ComplyAdvantage is headquartered in London and has global hubs in New York, Lisbon, Singapore, and Cluj-Napoca. It is backed by Balderton Capital, Index Ventures, Ontario Teachers’ Pension Plan, Goldman Sachs, and Andreessen Horowitz. Learn more about compliance re-engineered for the age of AI at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://complyadvantage.com&quot;&gt;complyadvantage.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-15lmd62:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hi, we&#39;re Ondo Finance. Our mission is to provide institutional-grade, blockchain-enabled investment products and services. We have both a technology arm that develops decentralized finance technology, and an asset management arm that creates and manages tokenized funds. We were the first company to tokenize exposure to US Treasuries, and have since expanded into several other assets. We are also focused on incubating protocols that can support both tokenized real-world assets and traditional crypto.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Founded by folks from Goldman Sachs Digital Assets Team, we’re backed by some of the best investors in the world including Founders Fund, Coinbase Ventures, Pantera Capital, Tiger Global, and more. We are currently the leaders in the space in terms of AUM and are well capitalized to continue growing the firm. We&#39;re fully remote, with team members across the U.S.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Product Manager to help build and scale our Stocks product. This role sits at the intersection of consumer fintech, capital markets, and digital assets, and is an opportunity to shape how users access and interact with stocks and other real-world assets onchain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the development and growth of the product across the full lifecycle—from defining the strategy and roadmap to designing the user experience, navigating market structure and operational constraints, and shipping products to market. A core part of the role will be making the complexity of capital markets and blockchain infrastructure feel simple and intuitive for users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with engineering, design, legal, compliance, operations, and business teams to bring products to market and help define what the next generation of onchain investing looks like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product strategy, roadmap, and execution for Ondo’s stocks product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of customer needs and translate them into simple, intuitive product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead products from concept through launch and iteration, defining requirements, prioritizing features, and making thoughtful tradeoffs along the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design experiences that abstract away the complexity of brokerage, trading, settlement, and blockchain infrastructure for users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering and design to build high-quality consumer products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with legal, compliance, operations, and business teams to navigate the unique requirements of bringing traditional financial assets onchain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a detailed understanding of market structure, trading workflows, liquidity, and the competitive landscape across both traditional finance and crypto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer insights, product data, and market developments to identify opportunities and inform product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define Ondo’s longer-term product vision for how stocks and other real-world assets can exist and trade onchain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience building and shipping consumer-facing financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of capital markets and market structure, including how trading, order books, execution, and brokerage workflows operate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in securities market infrastructure, including a thorough understanding of clearing and settlement ecosystems and the operational mechanics of stock trading lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of the regulatory landscape and compliance frameworks for securities trading, with the ability to partner effectively with Legal and Compliance teams..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consumer product instincts, with the ability to turn complex financial concepts and infrastructure into intuitive user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a strong product culture and partnering closely with engineering and design to ship high-quality products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine, hands-on experience using crypto and DeFi products. You should be an active user of the ecosystem, not simply interested in the space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and product judgment, with the ability to prioritize effectively and make decisions in ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High degree of curiosity and an ability to quickly develop expertise across unfamiliar or rapidly evolving areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products at a brokerage, investing platform, trading application, neobroker, neobank, fintech, or crypto company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly on retail investing, equities, brokerage, or trading products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience in crypto or digital assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with real-world assets (RWAs), tokenization, or bringing traditional financial products onchain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with DeFi market structure, decentralized exchanges, liquidity, and onchain trading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on products that span both traditional financial infrastructure and blockchain-based systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation including salary, future token rights, and/or equity (according to your preferences) — we&#39;re well-funded and believe that great talent deserves great compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full benefits (medical, vision, and dental) and flexible vacation policy (PTO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Small remote-first team across many countries — you&#39;ll be an early team member helping shape our vision, culture, and design practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A+ colleagues — our team includes alumni from: Goldman Sachs, Blackrock, Two Sigma, Bridgewater, SpaceX, AWS, Meta, Google, Pinterest, McKinsey, Circle, Uniswap, Phantom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in-class investors — we are proud to be backed by leading crypto experts and VCs, including Pantera Capital, Founders Fund and Coinbase Ventures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1rbq2sq:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Go-to-Market (GTM) Strategic Programs team supports Stripe&#39;s mission (to &quot;Increase the GDP of the internet&quot;) by building GTM strategy, bringing it to life through incubation programs, and providing program management expertise across global, cross-functional programs. We bring a desire to chart the unknown, rigorous thinking, and a user-first approach to problem-solving, while helping to build connections between Stripe go-to-market teams and the business overall.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we rapidly grow our company and customer base, we need &quot;full stack&quot; program management experts with global program experience who easily flex between:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMO responsibilities coordinating across a number of cross-functional team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running the full breadth of building and operationalizing incubation programs from diagnosis, design, implementation, and change management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving a successful transition and handover to operational counterparts across GTM and Product Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Program Managers are focused on solving GTM&#39;s most pressing challenges. We&#39;re looking for a self-starter who has demonstrated success dealing with ambiguous global-scale programs, with multi-layered stakeholder management and significant cross-functional team engagement. You have worked in a hypergrowth technology or GTM org or come from a strategic consulting background, have superior communication skills to work across the most senior stakeholders across different functions, and thrive when solving complex problems with limited oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for building and driving large-scale programs end-to-end, and be directly responsible for marshaling the cross-functional support and resources needed to accomplish your goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage directly (or coordinate) the &quot;full-stack&quot; of change management activities across stakeholder engagement and creating champions, messaging and communication planning, and support and enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong collaborative relationships with key stakeholders across Stripe across levels and functions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to identify improvement opportunities for the Revenue teams spanning strategy, people, process, and technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a Programs Center of Excellence, providing guidance, consulting, and coaching to peers and others on partner teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seamlessly prioritize among various projects and synthesize data to guide and support strategy and decision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make C-suite-level recommendations and drive decisions, where necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a sales and marketing organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in program management, business operations, management consulting, or a related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of delivering global, complex programs with multiple constituents in a changing, ambiguous environment end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An enthusiastic &quot;roll up your sleeves&quot; mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work well under pressure, with a high degree of adaptability and flexibility in a fast-paced, rapidly changing environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to diagnose, simplify, and structure problems and solutions while having command of &quot;the details&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, presentation, and communication experience, influencing across all levels from front lines to C-suite. You set a high bar in terms of communication effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated leadership qualities throughout their work—taking ownership of challenges, selflessly supporting their colleagues, and setting the standard for quality in their deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating with incomplete data and adapting and reprioritizing activities as business needs change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep problem-solving and analysis experience (solving business problems—commercial, operational, financial) in a sales-oriented environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset and innate curiosity where every interaction is an opportunity to learn and improve (yourself and those around you)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with payments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

