&lt;div&gt;Develop a pipeline of affiliates and partners, with audiences and communities to be referred to OKX. Affiliates and partners will be defined broadly based on fit, and may include a combination of: key opinion leaders, influencers, trading groups, websites, event organisers, professionals in relevant industries, and other companies serving customer bases with related interests.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
