&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Transparency&lt;/strong&gt;: The expected base salary range for this position based in Malta is 84,000 to 115,000 euros per year. This range reflects the position&#39;s requirements and represents a good faith framework determined by objective, gender-neutral criteria such as required skills, core competencies, and professional experience. This base range is exclusive of discretionary bonuses, equity allocations, and localized benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Fair Pay:&lt;/strong&gt; In compliance with the EU Pay Transparency Directive, FalconX evaluates applicants entirely on objective qualifications and the scope of the role. FalconX does not solicit, require, or consider a candidate’s current or historical compensation at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
