&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;OKX data team is responsible for the whole data scope of OKG, from techincal selection, architecture design, data ingestion, data storage, ETL, data visualization to business intelligence and data science. We are data engineers, data analysts and data scientists. The team has end-to-end ownership of most of the data at OKx throughout the whole data lifecycle including data ingestion, data ETL, data warehouse and data services.&amp;nbsp; As a data engineer of the team, you will work with the team to leverage data technologies to empower evidence-based decision-making and improve the quality of the company&#39;s products and services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and maintain the data warehouse for the risk control business domain, and develop the thematic metrics/indicator system to support data needs across all risk control business lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Design and implement the technical architecture for offline and real-time data application services, and optimize the performance of data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop reporting data and interface (API) data for the data mart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;richTextDocs-orderList richTextDocs-orderList-marker1 richTextDocs-orderList-number&quot; data-eleid=&quot;34&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;35&quot; data-index=&quot;1.&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;36&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher from an accredited university in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;37&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Computer Science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;38&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; or a related field, with &lt;strong&gt;4+ years of industry experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Real-time Data Engineering, &lt;/strong&gt;having used technologies like &lt;strong&gt;Flink&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of data warehouse modeling theory, with hands-on experience in data warehouse model design, in-depth knowledge of data warehouse architecture, and a track record of supporting real-world business scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with a range of big data architectures, especially Alibaba Cloud DataWorks/MaxCompute and AWS, as well as Spark, Databricks, and StarRocks/Doris (a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong communicator with business acumen and the ability to perform under pressure; able to quickly grasp business context and effectively bridge technical and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience building data middle-platform capabilities such as user profiling, risk control systems, and metrics systems is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
