&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gy4ydICWpol34Hxzjdhu4zdVshg&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and operate scalable, fault-tolerant, low-latency trading infrastructure and microservices that handle 24/7 crypto market operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain connectivity to centralized exchanges, DeFi venues, and counterparties using FIX 5.0+, WebSocket, HTTP/2, and REST — handling the real-world complexities of external integrations and on-chain data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain core services across the trading lifecycle: strategy and execution engines, automated pricing and trading bots, order execution and position tracking, trade &amp;amp; position data platforms, and risk &amp;amp; analytics systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and optimize high-throughput order execution with sub-millisecond latency targets, and build real-time market-data pipelines aggregating order books and price feeds across multiple venues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement pre-trade risk controls, circuit breakers, rate limiters, position/PnL and risk calculations, automated alerting, and high-availability architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement robust monitoring, alerting, and auto-recovery so strategies remain stable, scalable, and self-healing in a 24x7 trading environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted data models, reconciliation workflows, and data-quality controls with clear lineage, reproducibility, and documentation — delivering outputs for the trading desk, Finance, and Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profile and eliminate latency hotspots using garbage-free coding and lock-free concurrency; continuously improve system performance and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with liquidity managers, product managers, desk developers, risk, finance, and operations to design, implement, and roll solutions into production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct code reviews, mentor junior engineers, and uphold scalability, resiliency, maintainability, and security best practices across all development activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZvAmdvgIGoKyiHxjBTiu68Kcs9d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UhJ9dmqAXoYf0Rxmj2MuiHGesRc&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STEM foundation: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or above in Computer Science, Engineering, Mathematics, Physics, or a related technical discipline; a combined finance background is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Typically 3–8 years in software or data engineering (level-dependent), ideally with exposure to trading, OMS, middle/post-trade, or latency-sensitive systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong proficiency in one or more of Java (17+), Rust, C++, or Python, with a focus on code quality and operational reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong understanding of high-performance, low-latency distributed systems, multi-threaded/concurrent programming, and — where relevant — JVM internals and GC behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connectivity &amp;amp; protocols: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience with FIX 5.0+, WebSocket, HTTP/2, and REST APIs, plus network protocol and TCP/UDP optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; messaging: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong SQL (MySQL, PostgreSQL — schema design and performance tuning); experience with Redis and Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfortable in Linux/Unix environments; familiarity with Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud platforms (AWS, AliCloud, GCP) and on-premise infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Markets: &lt;/strong&gt;Understanding of market microstructure, order lifecycle, and core trading concepts such as PnL, margin, leverage, and market risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong analytical thinking, ownership, and attention to detail; able to work effectively under pressure in a fast-paced environment; a controls mindset around data quality and reproducibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills across business and technical teams; fluency in English required, with Chinese/Mandarin a strong plus for global, cross-functional work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion: &lt;/strong&gt;Genuine interest in crypto markets, blockchain, and the broader financial industry, and a drive to keep learning new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-DiLSdqfwUoKOraxakB6uGEomsXl&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pyddd7YwWoyKAJxFqgSutn7YsFc&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in proprietary trading, market making, quantitative research, or front-office technology at exchanges, banks, or investment institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with execution algorithms (TWAP, VWAP, iceberg, sniper, smart order routing) and backtesting / strategy-simulation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-latency tooling and IPC: Aeron, Chronicle Queue, Disruptor, shared-memory messaging, Agrona Collections, Protocol Buffers, SBE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frameworks and libraries such as Spring, Netty, and Vert.x.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern data platforms (Spark/PySpark, Iceberg, ClickHouse, InfluxDB), workflow orchestration (Airflow, Celery), and ML tooling (MLflow, TensorFlow).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of DeFi, blockchain, smart contracts, and crypto exchange APIs; exposure to event-contract / prediction markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic programming fluency — hands-on use of AI coding tools (e.g., Claude Code, Codex) on real production work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk and compliance experience; professional certifications such as CFA or FRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&amp;nbsp;
&lt;h2&gt;Technical Environment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;Java 17+, Rust, Python, C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protocols: &lt;/strong&gt;FIX 5.0+, WebSocket, HTTP/2, REST&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack: &lt;/strong&gt;Spring, Netty, Aeron, Chronicle Queue, Disruptor, Kafka, Redis, etcd, MySQL, PostgreSQL, InfluxDB, ClickHouse, Iceberg, Spark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure: &lt;/strong&gt;Linux/Unix, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, AWS / AliCloud / GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Team Specializations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Liquidity Platform comprises several engineering teams. Depending on your strengths and interests, you may join one of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delta One – Systematic Trading: &lt;/strong&gt;Build cross-venue liquidity and market-making strategies with deep market-microstructure and execution-optimization focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option Market Making: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and operate automated option market-making strategies and pricing systems — managing volatility, greeks, and inventory risk while quoting continuously across crypto options venues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cash OTC: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop and own OTC trading strategies and their production environment, partnering closely with liquidity and product managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trading Infra Service: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and maintain the core strategy engine and trading-infrastructure microservices on a distributed, enterprise-grade architecture. Deliver high-throughput, sub-millisecond order execution, market-data pipelines, and exchange connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the trade &amp;amp; position platform end-to-end — venue connectors, the Python + SQL data model, reconciliation, and data-quality controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Analytics: &lt;/strong&gt;Build a greenfield, next-generation risk platform — real-time risk monitoring, PnL/risk calculation, alerting, and circuit-breaking strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
