&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg99p7GTdNxeLcd3XQmSKpYg&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Security Operations Engineer who combines hands-on engineering skills with security operations expertise. You will be deeply involved in the operations and troubleshooting of both server-side and client-side components within our Zero Trust architecture, drive security risk governance initiatives, and leverage AI tools to continuously improve system stability and compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
