descriptions.job-09kp3my:
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus3bYvV5DS6icDHnquWbEcNb&quot;&gt;OKX will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Singapore, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussQumjJyp0pDHcFh7Y3bH0b&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl2cgB8vs7Q3ent4HKPgocd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;OvVyd3xPZo5hNhxbppju7P8isgg&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CzjQdI1IWofbWMxmIahu6dAMsjc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Q5McdBHqRos9a1xglGGuWZx7sgc&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl2cgB8vs7Q3ent4HKPgocd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusdoP7NU01oX9Z29HojysCiF&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;OAPtdHlrRo3CJdxGLe7lF2rYggd&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TWW0dikUlo8GOWxoKGHlOiKIgSe&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;DbB7dBZBvojngAxvoDslnb4Qgsb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qd9Xdb7ttoB5ulxWYluloyh8gur&quot;&gt;OKX is seeking an experienced VIP Growth &amp;amp; Operations Leader to focus on creating exclusive product experiences and service solutions for high-net-worth individuals, institutional clients, market makers, and other VIP customer segments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZOJ2dGkejoiBlfxXqbDlUoFLgpe&quot;&gt;You will spearhead the overall strategy and product planning for the VIP Growth &amp;amp; Operations line, driving customer lifecycle management, personalized services, and continuous optimization of system functionalities to enhance customer retention and platform AUM (Assets Under Management).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusJZ5t4Jnk2dRFRKdHIJXMmb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl2cgB8vs7Q3ent4HKPgocd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;DbB7dBZBvojngAxvoDslnb4Qgsb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Te9wdbUzXoLE2SxuFJblTukRgXf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the day-to-day &lt;strong&gt;VIP Growth &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt; execution for high-net-worth individual clients, ensuring VIP lifecycle programs are planned, launched, and iterated effectively.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GR0bd64YZoYT17xCBMglqMnsguc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and run a &lt;strong&gt;VIP lifecycle operations framework&lt;/strong&gt;: define segments, triggers, and journeys; set weekly/monthly operating rhythms; and ensure consistent execution with Local Markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IA3CdujgDo8eSQxu6TnlEfgrgVe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with &lt;strong&gt;Local Market teams&lt;/strong&gt; to to co-create market plans, align goals and timelines, and drive follow-through, while ensuring global consistency and scalable playbooks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NLqmdJzkuoAaBLxgBWNlaf4FgXb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Plan and execute &lt;strong&gt;VIP offsites and online events&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., product sharing sessions, community/engagement touchpoints), including end-to-end coordination, stakeholder alignment, and post-event performance review.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OsGpdOdXxoPNYdxCcMsllZgagvd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop and scale &lt;strong&gt;VIP growth programs and tools&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., VIP trial cards and similar programs) that improve conversion, deepen engagement, and increase VIP contribution to trading activity and AUM.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O3XEdY6vAoKWkXxQcDvlyCLgg4X&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Establish a data-driven growth operating model with clear measurement, experimentation, and continuous optimization to improve VIP contribution to revenue and AUM.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RwvTd4Vj7oy8G9xbABflmXcYgdj&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate with cross-functional teams (Product, Data, Engineering, Operations) to deliver workflows, tooling, and process improvements that support VIP operations at scale.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WZnTduk4RoRHT2xOzYplF8sigff&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Track performance and continuously optimize: define KPIs, monitor results, gather market feedback, and refine programs based on data and learnings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusJHbXag5ngXLLiXggj1zhBg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
