&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The OKX Data Engineering team is responsible for the whole data scope of OKG, from techincal selection, architecture design, data ingestion, data storage, ETL, data visualization to business intelligence and data science. The team has end-to-end ownership of most of the data at OKx throughout the whole data lifecycle including data ingestion, data ETL, data warehouse and data services.&amp;nbsp; As a data engineer of the team, you will work with the team to leverage data technologies to empower evidence-based decision-making and improve the quality of the company&#39;s products and services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;richTextDocs-unOrderList richTextDocs-unOrderList-disc&quot; data-eleid=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
