&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Design, build, and maintain &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;7&quot;&gt;analytics-ready Data Marts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;8&quot;&gt; using best-practice dimensional modeling (star/snowflake schemas)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Partner with analytics and business teams to understand requirements and deliver trusted, well-documented datasets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
